 ],
 "title": "In a vertical lab, equipment is brought to the operator",
 "speed": 1.5,
 "camera": "wide",
 "phases": [
  {
   "start_frame": 0,
   "text": "A vertical lab: storage that brings each instrument to the operator, a mobile robot arm."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 27,
   "text": "First its trays are loaded (a time-lapse): each comes down to the opening, and people put its instruments on."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 70,
   "text": "Tray A: Opentrons OT-2, CubXL + NuVant EZstat Pro, with its UPS and its camera posts."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 115,
   "text": "Tray A goes back up to its slot, where it has power, and tray B comes down."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 187,
   "text": "Tray B: the multi-doser v5 on its balance, the charge cups in their rack, and the vacuum press."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 232,
   "text": "Only then does the robot come in: it docks at the opening, to work at tray B."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 291,
   "text": "The arm stands an empty charge cup on its cup fork: its gripper can't reach into the doser."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 408,
   "text": "One powder in each module: the chain brings the Si to the balance, and 3.92 g of it goes into the cup ..."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 666,
   "text": "... then the AlSi10Mg module: 3.91 g on top, for Al-10Si."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 888,
   "text": "The arm puts the fork back, and stands the charged cup in the carrier on the robot."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 1037,
   "text": "Tray B goes back into storage, and the robot takes the cup to the atomizer."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 1125,
   "text": "At the atomizer, the arm pulls the lid's draw latch open and lifts the lid by its knob."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 1275,
   "text": "With a loading tong, the arm takes the cup and sets it on the crucible's floor, past the sealing rod."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 1478,
   "text": "The arm shuts the lid and the latch, and the locking bolt goes in."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 1623,
   "text": "The atomizer melts the cup and sprays the melt into powder (a time-lapse, cut open)."
  },
  {
   "start_frame": 1736,
   "text": "The robot has moved off, to wait for its next job."
  }
 ]
}
